menu "e32p: pcnt"

    config E32P_PCNT_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_pcnt (pulse counter)"
        depends on SOC_PCNT_SUPPORTED
        default n
        help
            Facade over the ESP-IDF v5.x pulse counter: count rising/falling edges
            on a GPIO, with an optional io_loop_back test mode (feed the GPIO's own
            output back to its input, so gpio_set_level generates counts).

endmenu
